    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nA new owner's membershipLevel cannot exceed one above the current maximum membershipLevel among their household members; return the capped 'membershipLevel'. With no existing household member no cap applies.\n"
